# Frontend

The preview page renders LayoutIR, not ad-hoc slide markup.

- Keep the canvas 16:9
- Prefer the consulting theme tokens already resolved into LayoutIR
- Do not add decorative illustration that will not exist in PPTX
- Export PPTX via `/api/export/pptx` so PptxGenJS stays server-side

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="grid grid-cols-2">...hard-coded sample bullets...</div>

// GOOD
<SlideCanvas layout={compiled.layouts[0]} />
```
